kit='Use case: ui-mockup. Full-screen high-fidelity Roblox game UI rebuild reference. Match the supplied art EXACTLY: chunky voxel toys, near-black outlines, vivid flat colours, stepped navy/cyan panel edges and square studs, top-left highlights. This is a clean front-on UI screenshot, not a 3D diorama. ONLY use imagery from the supplied existing icon/knife/frame sheets and the stated reusable assets; all other elements are native text, flat fills, rectangles, bars or simple markers. NO new mascots, portraits, specialty icons, decorations or one-off art. Clear white chunky rounded lettering with dark stroke. Use plain labels that Claude can recreate in Luau. Keep text legible, preserve full knife padding, never crop icons. '
